1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
If your windshield's fogging up,
don't hit this button.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Recirculate traps the moist air
already inside your cabin.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,000
That's the opposite of what you want
when the glass is already fogged.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Turn off recirculate, crank the defrost,
and add the AC — even in winter.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
The AC pulls the humidity out of the air
so the fog can't reform.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
One clue, one fix — stop by
and we'll take a look.
